        "text": "204"
      },
      {
        "key": "E",
        "text": "205"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "D",
    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Smallest such year",
        "body": "The prime digits are 2, 3, 5 and 7. Years from 2018 to 2999 start with 2, so the next digit must be prime too: at least 2, so the year is at least 2200, and then the smallest choice is 2222. Check that no year between 2018 and 2222 works: any year from 2019 to 2199 has second digit 0 or 1, which are not prime; from 2200 to 2221 the last two digits contain 0 or 1. So the next year is 2222, which is $2222 - 2018 = 204$ years away.\n\n**Answer: (D) 204**"
      }
    ],
