        "title": "List the next palindromes",
        "body": "In 3 hours at most 100 km/h he drives at most 300 km, so the final reading is at most 30092. The palindromes after 29792 are 29892, 29992, 30003, 30103, ... The largest one not above 30092 is 30003, which is $30003 - 29792 = 211$ km further. His maximum average speed is $\\frac{211}{3}$ km/h.\n\n**Answer: (C) $\\frac{211}{3}$ km/h**"
