        "text": "11 years old"
      },
      {
        "key": "E",
        "text": "10 years old"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "E",
    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Try the options",
        "body": "His birthday has passed, so if he is $n$ years old he was born in $2018 - n$.\n\n- 5: born 2013, digit sum 6 ✗\n- 7: born 2011, digit sum 4 ✗\n- 9: born 2009, digit sum 11 ✗\n- 11: born 2007, digit sum 9 ✗\n- 10: born 2008, digit sum $2 + 0 + 0 + 8 = 10$ ✓\n\n**Answer: (E) 10 years old**"
      },
      {
        "title": "Set up an equation",
        "body": "For a birth year $\\overline{20ab}$: age $= 18 - 10a - b$ and digit sum $= 2 + a + b$. So $18 - 10a - b = 2 + a + b$, i.e. $11a + 2b = 16$, giving $a = 0$, $b = 8$. (A year $\\overline{19ab}$ would need $11a + 2b = 108$, which has no digit solution.) He was born in 2008 and is 10.\n\n**Answer: (E) 10 years old**"
      }
    ],
